      "writtenOn": "2022-09-15T16:54:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think I completely understood this. I\u0027m unable to find any resource explaining these tags. Added `blueprint:\"mutated\"` to `Enforce_default_target_sdk_version` if that\u0027s what you meant.",
      "parentUuid": "5ea570c3_e17626e7",
      "revId": "e15a971aa6078756890df7a22135c4f9de1ef9d9",
